DESCRIPTION:Yvette Segan is a comedian\, actor\, writer\, and producer (wow
  she does it all!). She is based in NYC but performs standup literally all 
 over the world. She headlined as part of New York Comedy Festival\, 2024 an
 d 2025. Her sarcastic\, dark comedy and incessant posting have amassed her 
 a following of over 500k across platforms. Her goofy little internet videos
  have been featured by Buzzfeed\, Betches\, New Yorkers\, and Barstool. She
  is also the co-creator and star of Run Club: The Web Series. Instagram [ha
